+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+Certificate verification is enforced on all builds, including development builds: the team rejected the earlier development-only workaround that disabled TLS certificate verification and decided that certificate verification is mandatory across every build configuration, ensuring a consistent security posture and preventing verification-disabled configurations from being carried into production.
